ow what's the conversion formula for this is though.\r\n\r\n(This should use the shader preprocessor, so that it keeps working if you convert the BaseMaterial3D to a ShaderMaterial then switch rendering methods.)","created_at":"2024-12-09T21:14:03Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T21:14:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100211#discussion_r1876766611","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100211","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1876766611"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100211#discussion_r1876766611"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100211"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1876766611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":null,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1876420473,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":33,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1876795153","pull_request_review_id":2490161492,"id":1876795153,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5v3Z8R","diff_hunk":"@@ -1404,6 +1409,21 @@ void fragment() {)\";\n )\";\n \t}\n \n+\tif (depth_offset_enabled) {\n+\t\tcode += R\"(\n+\t// Depth Offset: Enabled\n+\t// Force transparency on the material (required for depth offset).\n+\tALPHA = 1.0;\n+\tvec4 view_position = INV_PROJECTION_MATRIX * vec4(SCREEN_UV * 2. - 1.0, FRAGCOORD.z, 1.0);\n+\tvec3 view_direction = normalize(VIEW);\n+\tview_position.xyz /= view_position.w;\n+\tview_position.xyz -= depth_offset * view_direction;\n+\tvec4 ndc_position = PROJECTION_MATRIX * vec4(view_position.xyz, 1.0);\n+\tndc_position.xyz /= ndc_position.w;","path":"scene/resources/material.cpp","commit_id":"2791288ef433c6c53b4802b8d7ed34045eb25001","original_commit_id":"62e893cfef20c46552abd0d6d564e487a4a3c763","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think the Compatibility view position snippet is this, a variation of what is documented [here](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/shaders/advanced_postprocessing.html#depth-texture):\r\n```\r\n#if CURRENT_RENDERER == RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY\r\nvec4 view_position = INV_PROJECTION_MATRIX * vec4(SCREEN_UV * 2. - 1.0, FRAGCOORD.z * 2. - 1.0, 1.0);\r\n#else\r\nvec4 view_position = INV_PROJECTION_MATRIX * vec4(SCREEN_UV * 2. - 1.0, FRAGCOORD.z, 1.0);\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nor\r\n```\r\n#if CURRENT_RENDERER == RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY\r\nvec4 view_position = INV_PROJECTION_MATRIX * vec4(vec3(SCREEN_UV, FRAGCOORD.z) * 2. - 1.0, 1.0);\r\n#else\r\nvec4 view_position = INV_PROJECTION_MATRIX * vec4(SCREEN_UV * 2. - 1.0, FRAGCOORD.z, 1.0);\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nBut you probably also need to convert NDC.z again when setting depth:\r\n```\r\n#if CURRENT_RENDERER == RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY\r\nDEPTH = ndc_position.z * 0.5 + 0.5;\r\n#else\r\nDEPTH = ndc_position.z;\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nAgain, I only have casual user shader knowledge of this, and my understanding of the underlying coordinate spaces is still fuzzy.\r\n\r\nSince the material writes out a GDShader, not GLSL directly, we still have access to the preprocessor here, right?","created_at":"2024-12-09T21:37:01Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T21:37:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100211#discussion_r1876795153","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100211","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1876795153"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100211#discussion_r1876795153"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100211"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1876795153/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":null,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1876420473,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":33,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1876807502","pull_request_review_id":2490179661,"id":1876807502,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5v3c9O","diff_hunk":"@@ -1404,6 +1409,21 @@ void fragment() {)\";\n )\";\n \t}\n \n+\tif (depth_offset_enabled) {\n+\t\tcode += R\"(\n+\t// Depth Offset: Enabled\n+\t// Force transparency on the material (required for depth offset).\n+\tALPHA = 1.0;\n+\tvec4 view_position = INV_PROJECTION_MATRIX * vec4(SCREEN_UV * 2. - 1.0, FRAGCOORD.z, 1.0);\n+\tvec3 view_direction = normalize(VIEW);\n+\tview_position.xyz /= view_position.w;\n+\tview_position.xyz -= depth_offset * view_direction;\n+\tvec4 ndc_position = PROJECTION_MATRIX * vec4(view_position.xyz, 1.0);\n+\tndc_position.xyz /= ndc_position.w;","path"